  <releases>
    <release version="__VERSION__" date="__DATE__">
      <description>
        <ul>
          <li>The window size and position are now remembered between sessions</li>
          <li>New application icon</li>
          <li>Files with FRENCH in their name now get the French audio language preselected</li>
          <li>Audio tracks with an unknown language are no longer named AD</li>
          <li>The TheTVDB series search is now retried without stop words when a full title returns nothing, e.g. The Falcon and the Winter Soldier</li>
          <li>TheTVDB and TheMovieDB requests now time out after 30 seconds and failed requests are no longer cached, so a temporary network problem no longer leaves videos loading indefinitely</li>
        </ul>
      </description>
    </release>
